==Detailed Walkthrough==
After completing [[Skyrim:The Horn of Jurgen Windcaller|The Horn of Jurgen Windcaller]], you can talk to [[Skyrim:Arngeir|Arngeir]] and tell him that you would like to learn more about the Voice.  He will respond:
:''"You have learned so much already, Dragonborn. Growing your gift too quickly would be dangerous. But there are many Words of Power in Skyrim, carved in the Dragon tongue. Even from here, we can feel the Thu'um resonate from them.  Finding these lost Words would be a sufficient test, to temper your abilities with experience. Ask when you are ready to search."''

Thereafter, you can ask him whether the Greybeards have located any words of power.  He has two possible replies:
:''"There is only silence right now. Perhaps later we will hear one of the lost Words."''
:''"We have felt the whisper of a Word. Give me your map, and I will show you where its echo can be found."''
The latter response will cause the location of the word wall to be marked on your map, and you will be given a new quest objective.

This quest can be repeated multiple times, and it can also be active simultaneously with the other word wall quest, [[Skyrim:Shout - learn about word wall|Shout - learn about word wall]]. Both quests can even point you to the same location as the other. However, if you choose to [[Skyrim:Paarthurnax (quest)|kill]] [[Skyrim:Paarthurnax (dragon)|Paarthurnax]] for the [[Skyrim:Blades|Blades]], this quest is no longer available.

==Notes==
*If you have ''[[Skyrim:Dragonborn|Dragonborn]]'' installed, Arngeir won't help you learn any Words of Power on [[Skyrim:Solstheim|Solstheim]].

==Bugs==
{{Bug|If sent to [[Skyrim:Arcwind_Point|Arcwind Point]], finding the word wall may not mark the quest as completed in your journal. Arcwind Point may be given as a destination even when the word wall has already been found, preventing progress in the quest.|UDGP|1.1a|confirmed=1}}
**{{pc22}} Using the command <code>SetStage FreeFormHighHrothgarA 20</code> will end the quest and allow you to acquire another quest normally. Setting Arcwind Point as cleared via <code>SetLocationCleared fd685 1</code> will prevent getting sent there again.
{{Bug|If you learn a word from a different word wall from the one that Arngeir points you to before visiting the quest-marked one, the test may be prematurely logged complete. For instance, after being directed to [[Skyrim:Shearpoint|Shearpoint]] by Arngeir, visiting [[Skyrim:Lost_Tongue_Overlook|Lost Tongue Overlook]] instead can complete the quest.  This is another possible solution for the Arcwind Point bug mentioned above.|confirmed=1}}

